  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math><br />Given: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now, for the moon,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
